    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nWell, I haven't really refined the art of Slot Addition.\nIt's so complicated that I'd be lying if I told you that I knew every factor that affected the process.\nStill, I do notice a few trends...",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n嗯，我还没完全掌握开槽这门技术。\n它太复杂了，要说我知道所有影响开槽的因素，那就是骗人。\n不过，我倒是发现了一些规律..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nIn some towns, Slot addition attempts are more successful for equipment with fewer upgrades.\nIn other towns, the opposite is true.\nisn't that really peculiar?",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n在有些城镇，精炼等级越低的装备，开槽成功率越高。\n在另一些城镇，情况却恰好相反。\n是不是很奇怪？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nOh, there's also something really important that you should know.\nIf you ask me to add a Slot to something, make sure that you don't have multiples of it in your inventory.",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n哦，还有一件很重要的事。\n如果您要让我为某件装备添加插槽，请确保背包里没有其他同款装备。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 232,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nHere's an example: if you have a +7 Manteau and a normal Manteau in your inventory, then I will randomly pick one of them for my Slot Addition attempt.\nJust remember to be careful.",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n比如，您的背包里同时有一件+7短斗篷和一件普通短斗篷，我就会随机选一件来开槽。\n千万要注意。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nAgain, ^FF0000only carry one of the equipment to which you want me to add a Slot^000000.\nAll other equipment with the same name should be placed in your Kafra Storage, got it?",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n再强调一次，^FF0000您想让我开槽的装备，只带一件就好^000000。\n其他同名装备都要放进卡普拉仓库，明白了吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Seiyablem",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nTake it easy, adventurer.\nIf you ever want to try adding a Slot to some of your equipment, come back and let me know.\nSeeya~",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n放轻松，冒险者。\n以后想给装备添加插槽，就回来找我。\n再见~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 256,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "placeholders" : [
        "getitemname(.@item_id)",
        ".@req_amount[0]",
        "getitemname(.@item_req[0])",
        "(.@req_amount[0] > 1 && .@item_req[0] != 999 ? \"s\":\"\")",
        "(.@item_req[1] != 0 && .@req_amount[1] != 0 ? (\"^FF0000\"+ .@req_amount[1] +\" \"+ getitemname(.@item_req[1]) + (.@req_amount[1] > 1 && .@item_req[1] != 999 ? \"s\":\"\") + \"^000000 \") : \"\")",
        "(.@zeny_req >= 1000 ? (.@zeny_req /1000 +\",000\") : .@zeny_req)",
        "getitemname(.@item_id)"
      ],
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nYou want to add a Slot to a {0}?\nAlright, please bring me ^FF0000{1} {2}{3}^000000, {4}and my ^FF0000{5},000 zeny^000000 service fee.\nAh, and don't forget to bring that {6}!",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n您想为{0}添加插槽？\n好，请带来^FF0000{1} {2}{3}^000000、{4}以及^FF0000{5},000 Zeny^000000的服务费。\n啊，别忘了带上{6}！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nI can try to add a slot now if you have the required items and zeny.\nHowever, you should know that there's a chance that I might fail.\nTherefore, I need to give you a fair warning...",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n只要您备齐所需物品和Zeny，我现在就能尝试开槽。\n不过，开槽是有可能失败的。\n所以，有些风险我得先说明白..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nIf you have all the required materials, my zeny service fee and the Armor, then we can go ahead with the Slot Addition attempt.\nBut before that, I must warn you of the risk.",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n只要您带齐所需材料、服务费和防具，我们就能尝试开槽。\n不过，在动手之前，我必须先说明风险。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nIf this attempt to add a Slot to your Weapon fails, then the ^FF0000Weapon^000000, ^FF0000and any Cards compounded to it will be destroyed^000000.\nDo you still want to try to add a Slot?",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n如果武器开槽失败，^FF0000武器^000000^FF0000和上面镶嵌的所有卡片都会被摧毁^000000。\n您还要尝试开槽吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 276,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nIf this attempt to add a Slot to your Armor fails, then the ^FF0000Armor^000000, ^FF0000it's upgrades^000000 ^FF0000and any Cards compounded to it will be destroyed^000000.\nDo you still want to try to add a Slot?",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n如果防具开槽失败，^FF0000防具^000000会被摧毁，^FF0000精炼等级^000000^FF0000和上面镶嵌的所有卡片也都会消失^000000。\n您还要尝试开槽吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 281,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Attempt Slot Addition",
      "translation" : "尝试添加插槽"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 281,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel",
      "translation" : "取消"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 286,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nAlright then, let the work begin!\nYou'd better pray for a successful result.",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n好，那就开工吧！\n祈祷这次能成功吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 294,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nGreat, it seems to be successful.\nIt looks pretty well done. Congratulations!",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n太好了，看来成功了。\n做得还不错，恭喜您！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nSee you again, buddy!",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n下次见，朋友！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nWah! ...I am so sorry, it failed.\nHowever, I am completely innocent.\nThis is your luck, and it is destined by god, okay?\nDon't be so disappointed, and try next time.",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n哇！...真抱歉，失败了。\n不过，这可不能怪我。\n这得看您的运气，成败都是上天注定的，明白吗？\n别太失望，下次再试吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nI wish you good luck next time!",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n祝您下次好运！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 329,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nI'd like to go ahead with this Slot Addition attempt, but you're missing a few things.\nYou sure that you have the equipment, required materials and the zeny?",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n我倒是想帮您开槽，可您还缺点东西。\n您确定装备、所需材料和Zeny都带齐了吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "npc" : "Func_Socket",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Seiyablem]\nNeed some time to think about it, huh?\nAlright, I can understand.\nJust remember that life's no fun if you're always playing it safe~",
      "translation" : "[赛亚布雷姆]\n还需要时间考虑一下，是吗？\n好，我能理解。\n不过，凡事都求稳，人生可就没什么乐趣了~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]\nI'm considering becoming a Slotting Engineer.\nIt's a new field where you can add Slots to equipment, and it'd be cool if I can work in such a lucrative career.",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]\n我正在考虑成为一名开槽工程师。\n这是个给装备添加插槽的新行当，要是能干上这么赚钱的工作，那该多好。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 353,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]\nThere's a huge element of luck involved in successfully adding Slots from what I can understand.\nYou fail sometimes, but if you're super lucky, you can add two Slots.\nCrazy. Huh?",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]\n据我了解，开槽能不能成功，很大程度上得看运气。\n有时候会失败，但要是运气特别好，还能加出两个插槽。\n厉害吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 358,
      "npc" : "Young Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Young Man]\nBut don't get too excited.\nOnly certain equipment can handle the addition of two extra Slots.\nThere's so much more I have to learn before I can even be an apprentice...",
      "translation" : "[年轻男子]\n不过，先别高兴得太早。\n只有特定装备才能增加两个插槽。\n想当个学徒，我都还有好多东西要学..."
    }
  ]
}
